  "text": "A conversation with Sol\n\nThe same bird, repaired\n\nSol’s picture workbench\n\nWhat Sol tells you next\n\nPlay from the beginning\n\nWent away from a place.\n\nRead a short part aloud\n\nAsk Sol about his draft\n\nThe number after three.\n\nObservations and notes\n\nA word you don’t know?\n\nBegin doing something.\n\nAble to be used again.\n\nMara finished her work\n\nYOUR PLAN HAPPENS HERE\n\nChecking your reading…\n\nRead without narration\n\nYour rolling projector\n\nSlide out of position.\n\nSet post in its socket\n\nSet something upright.\n\nBefore all the others.\n\nPut words onto a page.\n\nCheck this explanation\n\nRead the crossing note\n\nA meal eaten outdoors.\n\nm204 132 7 4m-8 6 13 3\n\nReceiving or becoming.\n\nA gathering that works\n\nPause · Back to studio\n\nRina’s spare roof tile\n\nMove held object right\n\nBelonging to the boat.\n\nSpeaking with someone.\n\nToward a higher place.\n\nHear this conversation\n\nA hard piece of stone.\n\nAbout reading feedback\n\nClose reading practice\n\nMy ideas and questions\n\nAs much as is needed.\n\nM180 168v16m103-16v16\n\nThe ending Sol shared\n\nSaved in this browser\n\nBring the tile to Sol\n\nBack to the workbench\n\nM43 84 143 31l100 53Z\n\nRead what’s on screen\n\nSupport for my ending\n\nCertain or confident.\n\nToward a lower place.\n\nRestore previous save\n\nLocal review controls\n\nby the dock-side bank\n\nBegin Pip’s adventure\n\nUse suggested picture\n\nDiscovered something.\n\nGo away from a place.\n\nPrevious reading page\n\nm41 142-3-26h47l3 26Z\n\nSol: knows this time.\n\nThat path is blocked.\n\nThe day before today.\n\nReread Mara’s account\n\nBack to the seed boat\n\nMore than one person.\n\nHow big something is.\n\nListen to my words as\n\nBack to the adventure\n\nM4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\n\nRead the conversation\n\nRead the story so far\n\nHelp at Rina’s bakery\n\nHandle nearby objects\n\nMoved something down.\n\nTake the ropes to Pip",
